<speak version='1.0' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis' xmlns:mstts='https://www.w3.org/2001/mstts' xml:lang='en-US'><voice name='en-US-MultiTalker-Ava-Andrew:DragonHDLatestNeural'><mstts:dialog><mstts:turn speaker="ava">Number one.<break time="1350ms"/></mstts:turn><mstts:turn speaker="andrew">The recording for our school radio show still isn't in the shared folder.<break time="550ms"/></mstts:turn><mstts:turn speaker="ava">I finished editing it, but the file is too large to send by email. Could you upload it from the media room?<break time="550ms"/></mstts:turn><mstts:turn speaker="andrew">Sure, but I need the final title before lunch because the teacher checks everything at one.<break time="550ms"/></mstts:turn><mstts:turn speaker="ava">I'll message you the title now. The interview section doesn't need any more changes.<break time="1300ms"/></mstts:turn><mstts:turn speaker="ava">Question.<break time="350ms"/></mstts:turn><mstts:turn speaker="ava">What does the girl ask the boy to do?</mstts:turn></mstts:dialog></voice></speak>
